thub.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Add UTC calendar-month arithmetic with month-end clamping.\n- Move email renewal from fixed 90 days to three calendar months from the last successful verification.\n- Add separate one-month biometric and three-month email due-date primitives and focused tests.\n- Use the persisted email cycle expiry directly rather than reconstructing it with a fixed-day subtraction.\n- Record the remaining Super Owner biometric workflow blockers in the phase-one gap register.\n\n## Validation\nGitHub Actions checks for head `615f9f974ea9e252772bee43339261288b7a2729` completed successfully:\n- Isolated ClamAV scanner gateway tests and image build\n- Flutter analysis, tests and web build\n- Cloud Functions compile and unit tests\n- Retention and room reservation emulator regression\n- Flutter UI analysis and widget tests\n- Mawdda domain regression workflow\n- Validate Mawda workflow\n\nThese are GitHub-hosted results only. They do not constitute full biometric workflow acceptance.\n\n## Scope boundary\nThis PR does **not** implement or enable the Super Owner biometric submission/review workflow. The current biometric callable remains fail-closed, and the existing attestation-based gate conflicts with the approved manual-review policy. It must not be weakened to client-writable state. The three-attempt state machine, private audio/video review, Super Owner-only server authorization, evidence deletion lifecycle, and exactly-once 1,500 BetaCoins award remain blockers.\n\nNo main merge, production deployment, Firebase production mutation, billing, external tests or 5,000-persona simulation is included.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T13:5